    # gato "Look, loser's loser. Don't even think about tryin' any tricks on us experienced lots."
    gato "听着，输家就是输家。别想在我们这些老手面前耍花招。"

translate schinese_rewrite Nocturnal_Trunk_Cardy_End_13aac4cf:

    # "You turn your head."
    "你转过头去。"

