    # e "My name is [e]. Nice to meet you Lothar. I've only arrived here yesterday, I'm so sorry that I didn't know about you."
    e "我叫[e]。很高兴认识你，洛萨尔。我昨天才到这里，对不起，我不知道你是谁。"

