    # l "Yes, the lizard talked to me about your name. He talked to you about me as well, didn't he. But I forgive you, [e]." nointeract
    l "没错，那只蜥蜴跟我提过你的名字。他也跟你提过我，对吧？不过我原谅你了，[e]。" nointeract

